# Files that should never leak into the docker build context.
#
# vendor/ is .gitignored but a maintainer with a populated local
# vendor folder used to ship it into the image, masking the fact
# that fresh clones couldn't build. The Dockerfile now uses
# `go mod download` instead of `-mod=vendor` so vendor must be
# excluded here to keep build behaviour consistent across
# maintainer + fresh-clone runs.
vendor/

# Build artefacts that have no business in the image.
indexer
indexer.exe
*.exe

# Test + tool data that bloats context without contributing.
data/
dist/
.git/
.github/
.vscode/
.idea/

# IDE + editor scratch.
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
